		{
			dependencies: ["2A0238D4FDD5FF80"]
			description: [
				"&6FTB Quests&r provides a powerful, dynamic framework to guide you through every step of your journey across &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.  "
				"Whether you're a seasoned explorer, a master builder, or a brave new adventurer, FTB Quests keeps your goals clear, your progress organized, and your efforts richly rewarded."
				""
				"Prepare to forge your legacy one milestone at a time!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Navigating Your Adventure&r  "
				""
				"- &eGear Icons&r: Quests marked with gear icons represent the starting points of each chapter and critical progression paths.  "
				"  Follow these first-they unlock the core objectives and challenges you’ll need to master."
				""
				"- &eInteractive Layout&r: Navigate through beautifully structured quest trees, designed for clarity and momentum.  "
				"  Track your achievements, chart your next goals, and watch your story unfold with every step."
				""
				"- &eTeam-Friendly Progression&r: Play solo or with friends!  "
				"  FTB Quests fully supports team play, allowing every member to contribute to shared progress and reap the rewards of collective success."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Master the Journey&r  "
				"With FTB Quests, every achievement is meaningful, every chapter brings new purpose, and every challenge sharpens your skills.  "
				"Storytelling, rewards, and visual progression come together to create an immersive adventure that keeps you engaged from your first build to your greatest triumph."
				""
				"Follow the gears. Blaze your trail.  "
				"Forge your path to greatness-&6FTB Quests&r transforms your journey into a true epic! "
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "ftbquests:book"
			id: "6F8E433E11AB988B"
			rewards: [
				{
					id: "00F51B51F7F587AD"
