		{
			dependencies: ["2A0238D4FDD5FF80"]
			description: [
				"&6FTB Homes&r empowers you to forge your own network of safe havens, resource hubs, and exploration outposts across the world.  "
				"With up to &e4 homes available by default&r, your adventure becomes more flexible, efficient, and expansive than ever before."
				""
				"Whether you're tunneling deep into the mines, building a mechanical empire, or braving the wild frontiers, FTB Homes ensures you’re always just a command away from safety."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Using FTB Homes&r  "
				"FTB Homes is simple, intuitive, and incredibly powerful:"
				""
				"- &e/sethome [name]&r: Save your current location as a home. Assign it a meaningful name like “base,” “mine,” or “outpost” for quick reference."
				"- &e/home [name]&r: Instantly teleport to any of your saved homes by entering its assigned name."
				""
				"No matter where your journey takes you, returning home has never been easier."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nTake command of your adventure.&r  "
				"Design a world where you can always find your footing, where every major location becomes a simple heartbeat away.  "
				"With FTB Homes, your world becomes truly yours to master-one home at a time."
				""
				"Build your legacy, explore fearlessly, and make every corner of the world your own! "
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "handcrafted:oak_fancy_bed"
			id: "0152665A72057299"
			rewards: [{
				id: "626F3B3A4B320CEB"
				type: "xp"
				xp: 25
			}]
			subtitle: "Master FTB Homes and unlock the freedom to roam, build, and thrive. Click me to learn more!"
			tasks: [{
				advancement: "minecraft:adventure/sleep_in_bed"
				criterion: ""
				id: "16F8B441C6369F1D"
				type: "advancement"
			}]
			title: "Forge Your Network"
			x: -1.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2A0238D4FDD5FF80"]
			description: [
				"&6FTB Chunks&r grants you full control over your world-empowering you to claim, protect, and manage your space with confidence.  "
				"Whether you're building sprawling factories, cozy bases, or thriving villages, FTB Chunks ensures your creations are safe, organized, and truly yours."
				""
				"From protection to powerful mapping tools, FTB Chunks is the key to mastering your domain!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Claiming Your Territory&r  "
				""
				"- &eClaim Chunks&r: Safeguard your builds and resources by claiming chunks.  "
				"  Protect your area from unauthorized block breaking, container access, or interference from others."
				""
				"- &eMap Interface&r: Navigate and manage your claimed territory easily using an intuitive map.  "
				"  View your claimed zones, organize your space, and expand your empire with just a few clicks."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Build Together, Stronger&r  "
				""
				"- &eTeam Collaboration&r: Form alliances and share your claimed chunks with teammates.  "
				"  Collaborate on grand projects, tackle dungeons together, or establish bustling communities-all while keeping your work protected."
				""
				"- &eWaypoint Management&r: Mark critical locations like mines, resource hubs, and exploration points directly on your map, making navigation and organization effortless."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Important Note: Chunk Loading&r  "
				"- Chunk loading via FTB Chunks is &cdisabled&r in this pack to preserve performance.  "
				"- If you need continuous operation for your contraptions, explore alternative options such as the &eCreate Power Loaders&r to maintain chunk activity."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nTake command of your frontier.&r  "
				"FTB Chunks gives you the power to claim your space, protect your progress, and collaborate without limits.  "
				"Whether you’re forging your path alone or building a kingdom with allies, these tools ensure that your world remains firmly under your control."
				""
				"Secure your legacy, manage your empire, and explore fearlessly-&6FTB Chunks&r is your ultimate ally in building the future! "
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:map"
			id: "484FC6F80FEDC87E"
