		{
			description: [
				"This chapter is your gateway to mastering the powerful features that will elevate your experience in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.  "
				"Whether you're building sprawling bases, managing resources, or charting vast, uncharted lands, the tools introduced here will make your journey smoother, more efficient, and infinitely more rewarding."
				""
				"Prepare to take control of your adventure like never before!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l FTB Homes&r  "
				"Unlock the freedom to explore without fear of losing your way.  "
				"Master the use of &e/sethome&r and &e/home&r commands to set personal waypoints-whether it’s your main base, a hidden mine, or a trading outpost.  "
				"With up to four homes available by default, your empire can span continents with ease."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l FTB Essentials&r  "
				"Empower your survival with critical utility commands:  "
				"- &e/tpa&r and &e/tpahere&r to teleport to friends and allies.  "
				"- &e/spawn&r to return to the safety of civilization.  "
				"- &e/rtp&r to journey into the unknown and discover new lands.  "
				"FTB Essentials ensures you're never stranded, always connected, and ready for anything the world throws at you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l FTB Chunks&r  "
				"Secure your territory with ease.  "
				"Learn how to claim land using the intuitive chunk map system, organizing your domain for safety and expansion.  "
				"Note: Chunk loading is disabled by default-you’ll need to explore other options like Chunk Loaders if you seek automated setups and remote operations."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l FTB Quests&r  "
				"Follow a guided path through the modpack’s progression with FTB Quests.  "
				"- &eGear Icons&r mark the start of new chapters and adventures.  "
				"- &eStar and Chest Icons&r highlight key milestone quests and rewards.  "
				"Quests provide structure, lore, and rewards-turning every achievement into a celebrated moment on your journey."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nMastering these essential tools transforms survival into triumph.&r  "
				"Whether you're forging your path alone or rising as part of a great team, these features are designed to empower you at every step.  "
				"Navigate smarter. Build bigger. Conquer faster. This chapter is your first step toward complete mastery of your world."
				""
				" Prepare to claim your legacy-and revolutionize your journey across Forge Frontier! "
			]
