		{
			dependencies: ["2A0238D4FDD5FF80"]
			description: [
				"&6FTB Essentials&r brings a powerful suite of survival-focused commands designed to streamline your journey and amplify your adventures across &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.  "
				"Whether you're exploring new frontiers, recovering lost ground, or rallying your allies, these tools help you focus on what truly matters-building, thriving, and conquering the unknown."
				""
				"Unlock the full potential of your survival experience with FTB Essentials!"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Essential Travel Commands&r  "
				""
				"- &e/back&r: Instantly return to your last location-whether after an untimely death or a quick teleport. Never lose track of your progress again."
				""
				"- &e/rtp&r: Randomly teleport to an unexplored region of the world, perfect for gathering new resources, establishing distant outposts, or discovering hidden wonders."
				""
				"- &e/spawn&r: Safely return to your world’s central spawn point whenever you need a reset, a rallying point, or a moment to regroup."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Team Up with Ease&r  "
				""
				"- &e/tpa [player]&r: Send a request to teleport directly to another player-ideal for quick meet-ups, rescue missions, or coordinated adventures."
				""
				"- &e/tpahere [player]&r: Invite another player to teleport to your location. Share your latest discovery, summon your allies to battle, or simply bring friends closer to your adventures."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nMastering Essentials empowers you to survive smarter-and thrive faster.&r  "
				"These survival tools are crafted to enhance your freedom while preserving the creativity and challenge at the heart of Minecraft.  "
				"With FTB Essentials by your side, the world becomes more accessible, exploration becomes second nature, and teamwork becomes effortless."
				""
				"Seize the tools of mastery. Explore with confidence. Adventure without limits! "
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			icon: "minecraft:oak_sign"
			id: "3459B4FBA6296581"
