		{
			dependencies: ["2A0238D4FDD5FF80"]
			description: [
				"&6FTB Ultimine&r revolutionizes the way you mine, build, and explore in &6Create - Forge Frontier&r.  "
				"Gone are the days of slow, block-by-block excavation-Ultimine empowers you to carve through the world with unprecedented speed and precision."
				""
				"With a single key press, you can harvest massive swaths of terrain, unveil hidden ores, and shape the landscape to match your vision.  "
				"From intricate underground bases to towering resource operations, Ultimine ensures your tools work as fast as your imagination."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Efficiency Meets Customization&r  "
				"FTB Ultimine puts the power in your hands with a suite of customizable options:"
				""
				"- &eConfigurable Mining Shapes&r: Tunnel through caves, mine in 3x3 patterns, strip ores with vein mining, and more. Select the perfect shape for the task and let Ultimine handle the heavy lifting.  "
				"- &eAccelerated Resource Collection&r: No more tedious digging. Gather stone, ores, and materials in moments-all dropped neatly at your feet.  "
				"- &eCreate Compatibility&r: Thanks to a dedicated addon, Ultimine now supports the &bCreate Wrench&r and &bItem Application&r tools-perfect for clearing complex builds or dismantling contraptions with ease."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&l Dig Deeper, Build Bigger&r  "
				"FTB Ultimine transforms mining into a creative force-removing the grind so you can focus on what truly matters: crafting masterpieces, exploring new horizons, and expanding your frontier."
				""
				"Whether you’re hollowing out mountain halls, harvesting massive ore veins, or fine-tuning mechanical structures, Ultimine ensures every strike counts."
				""
				"&nOne press. A hundred blocks. Infinite possibilities.&r  "
				"With FTB Ultimine, the world bends to your will. "
			]
